# Empaquetage par BigWigsMods/packager (CurseForge, Wago, GitHub Releases)
package-as: ForeverPath

enable-nolib-creation: no

ignore:
  - tests
  - tools
  - .github
  - .luacheckrc
  - .gitignore
  - CONTRIBUTING.md
  - INTEGRATIONS.md

manual-changelog:
  filename: CHANGELOG.md
  markup-type: markdown
